# Build context trimming for the four service images (deploy/local/compose.yaml builds
# each of them with the REPO ROOT as context, because the Dockerfiles need the parent POM
# and the shared/* modules). Without this file every build ships target/, .git and the
# docs tree to the daemon on every rebuild.
.git
.github
.gitignore
**/target
docs
deploy/k8s
deploy/helm
.idea
*.iml
.env
*.log
